  {
   "id": "VFreeformGoodspringsGSRingoTopic003",
   "section": "topics",
   "responses": [
    {
     "text": "Just keep an eye out for them while you travel. I've found cards in old boxes or forgotten on shelves. Can find some for sale, too.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    }
   ],
   "prompt": "Where can I find more cards?"
  },
  {
   "id": "VFreeformGoodspringsGSRingoTopic004",
   "section": "topics",
   "responses": [
    {
     "text": "It's all I've got with me, but if you look me up at the Crimson Caravan's main camp in New Vegas, I'll pay you in full.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    }
   ],
   "prompt": "Seems a little light for the work I did."
  },
  {
   "id": "VFreeformGoodspringsGSRingoTopic006",
   "section": "topics",
   "responses": [
    {
     "text": "All I've got left on me are a handful of caps, but you get me out of this, and I'll make sure the Crimson Caravan pays you back. You've got my word.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    }
   ],
   "prompt": "You need a hired gun. I'm available."
  },
  {
   "id": "VFreeformGoodspringsGSRingoTopic008",
   "section": "topics",
   "responses": [
    {
     "text": "I won't let you stick your neck out for free. I can't pay you back now, but I'll make sure the Crimson Caravan pays up. You've got my word.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    }
   ],
   "prompt": "I don't need payment."
  },
  {
   "id": "VFreeformGoodspringsGSRingoTopic009",
   "section": "topics",
   "responses": [
    {
     "text": "All right. Was there anything else you wanted to talk to me about?",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    }
   ],
   "prompt": "I'll consider it."
  },
  {
   "id": "VFreeformGoodspringsGSRingoTopic010",
   "section": "topics",
   "responses": [
    {
     "text": "I'll stick around for a bit longer, but I'll be gone in a few days. If you ever visit New Vegas, look me up at the Crimson Caravan camp.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    }
   ],
   "prompt": "You're welcome."
  },
  {
   "id": "VFreeformGoodspringsGSRingoTopic011",
   "section": "topics",
   "responses": [
    {
     "text": "I've never stopped here until recently. You're better off asking one of the locals.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    }
   ],
   "prompt": "Can you tell me anything about Goodsprings?"
  },
  {
   "id": "VFreeformGoodspringsGSRingoTopic012",
   "section": "topics",
   "responses": [
    {
     "text": "It's been in business for a very long time, and is probably the biggest trading outfit in California.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "There's a branch up in New Vegas, but it hasn't been doing so well. Word is that the big boss herself, Alice McLafferty, is coming in to fix things.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    }
   ],
   "prompt": "Tell me more about the Crimson Caravan Company."
  },
  {
   "id": "VFreeformGoodspringsGSRingoTopic013",
   "section": "topics",
   "responses": [
    {
     "text": "Err, thanks, I guess. Cobb wasn't the problem, though - I could've handled him if he ever found me.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "Cobb's friends are the bigger problem, and when he doesn't get back, they'll be coming here for blood. There's no way I fight can them all.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    }
   ],
   "prompt": "A man named Joe Cobb was looking for you, but I killed him."
  },
  {
   "id": "VFreeformGoodspringsGSRingoTopic014",
   "section": "topics",
   "responses": [
    {
     "text": "I did have what was left of the Crimson Caravan money, but I wasn't sure if it was my right to just give it away.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "I owe you more than that, though, so look me up at the Crimson Caravan camp up in New Vegas if you ever visit.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    }
   ],
   "prompt": "Didn't I hear you say something earlier about not being able to pay me now?"
  },
  {
   "id": "VFreeformGoodspringsGSRingoTopic015",
   "section": "topics",
   "responses": [
    {
     "text": "[FAILED] Look, I don't know you, so what I'm doing here isn't any of your business.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    }
   ],
   "prompt": "Is that the story you're going to stick with?"
  },
  {
   "id": "VFreeformGoodspringsGSRingoTopic016",
   "section": "topics",
   "responses": [
    {
     "text": "[SUCCEEDED] That is a pretty flimsy story, I guess. The real reason that I'm staying is because there's a group of men out to kill me.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    }
   ],
   "prompt": "Staying because you want to or because you have to? This is a good hiding spot."
  },
  {
   "id": "VFreeformGoodspringsGSRingoTopic019",
   "section": "topics",
   "responses": [
    {
     "text": "It's a two-player game, and the winner takes the whole pot. You build a \"caravan\" using the cards in your deck.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "The goal is to create caravan bids that beat your opponent's bids, so there's more strategy than luck involved.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "It's why you won't see Caravan in any casino - too slow-paced, and more importantly, no house edge.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "Here, take this holotape - it goes into more specifics about the rules. You'll also need a deck, so take one of my spares.",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    },
    {
     "text": "So... you feel like playing a game?",
     "emotion": "neutral",
     "intensity": 50
    }
   ],
   "prompt": "What are the rules of Caravan?"
