   "id": "VFreeformGoodspringsGoodspringsRingoTopic002",
   "section": "topics",
   "responses": [
    {
     "text": "Yeah. He doesn't look very tough, though. I hear he's afraid I'll shoot him down from one of the windows when I see him, and he's right.",
